# Import prompts
# Prompt
Create a new class named EnhancedFakeLogChecker.
(export default class EnhancedFakeLogChecker)

constructor should take an array of string (log lines), and other necessary parameters
to implement the required features (see below).

It shoulds allow to perform the following checks like:

Log contains some text and in the next 10 lines after it there is another text
checker.contains("some text").and().nextNLines(10).contains("next text")

Log contains some text and in the previous 10 lines before it there is another text
checker.contains("some text").and().previousNLines(10).contains("next text")

Log contains some text in one of the last 10 lines
checker.lastNLines(10).contains("some text in the end")

Apart from 'contains' method, 'containsRegex' method should be also available.

If text not found, please throw an exception. If exception not thrown then the result
is considered to be true.

Please consider the following issues and avoid them:
A 'this' type is available only in a non-static member of a class or interface.

Please use this import declaration:
import EnhancedFakeLogChecker from './../../testUtils/fakeLogger/enhancedFakeLogChecker';